    dialoguesFinalDays: []
  quarantineExitLines:
  - A room of my own? Maybe I'll finally finish that chapter.
  - These walls have such a particular texture. Very honest.
  killExitLines:
  - "So many more pages\u2026 left in the chapter\u2026"
  - "I hope someone\u2026 tends the plants\u2026 on my windowsill\u2026"
